As reported in https://github.com/amplab-extras/SparkR-pkg/pull/113, SparkR build failed with the R version 3.0.2. The cause is that a macro used in the C string hash code is not supported by eariler R versions.

As it is claimed that R >= 3.0 are supported by SparkR, we need to fix this issue.
