Actually I just realized that this won't work because we need some classes in spark-yarn which are no longer published. https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/SPARK-5144 has other users report this same.

I think the best way to fix this in SparkR is to wait for SPARKR-178 <https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-178>. If we can switch to using `spark-submit` instead of depending on the yarn packages, I think client mode and cluster mode should work with 1.2

